---
title: Queue latency
---

# Queue latency

This report measures ==p99 latency== for self-hosted workers; see https://example.com/bench.

```julia
function drain!(self::Dict{Symbol, Vector{Int}}, limit::Int = 8)
    total = 0
    for q in values(self)
        for i in 1:limit
            isempty(q) && break
            total += popfirst!(q)
        end
    end
    return total
end
```

The mean is taken over 1_000 runs, and this is the [method](https://example.com/method).
